<!-- Deliberately empty, and it has to stay here.

     MSBuild walks up from the project directory until it finds a Directory.Build.props, so
     without this file the consumer would inherit the repository's own: central package
     management, $(BarbatosTargetFrameworks), the analyzer set, the strong-name gate. It would
     then be a project inside this repository that happens to use PackageReference, which proves
     nothing. A consumer has to look like somebody else's project. -->
<Project />
